text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 终曲•寒芒出鞘.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/48/170wo8cdjyl9ssddy9cp7gtk5x0u0b6.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%BB%88%E6%9B%B2%E2%80%A2%E5%AF%92%E8%8A%92%E5%87%BA%E9%9E%98.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/48/170wo8cdjyl9ssddy9cp7gtk5x0u0b6.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%BB%88%E6%9B%B2%E2%80%A2%E5%AF%92%E8%8A%92%E5%87%BA%E9%9E%98.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/48/170wo8cdjyl9ssddy9cp7gtk5x0u0b6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />终曲•寒芒出鞘\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（治疗）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放枷锁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放枷锁</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，消耗2层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"杀机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">杀机</font></span></span>]，对目标地点范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"乱心\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">乱心</font></span></span>]（持续1回合）、<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"粉碎枷锁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">粉碎枷锁</font></span></span>]；自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲治疗2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▲治疗2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲暴击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲暴击2</font></span></span>]（持续2回合）。并对范围内拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"受治疗逆转\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">受治疗逆转</font></span></span>]类效果的敌人治疗，治疗量为魔攻值的<font color=\"#58cb48\">40%</font>；再对范围内友军治疗，治疗量为魔攻值的<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>。<br />✦拥有5层以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]时，消耗所有层数每消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>层，技能中的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲治疗2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▲治疗2</font></span></span>]提升<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>级,最多2级。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/88/gna3oc2cjl54ui7uiti4hvjxnhrilam.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/88/gna3oc2cjl54ui7uiti4hvjxnhrilam.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164112\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.512 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.701 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10201/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 174581/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 20423/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  676.814      1 模板:技能\n100.00%  676.814      1 -total\n 16.24%  109.943      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 15.30%  103.521     10 模板:中括号介绍\n  1.37%    9.295      1 模板:面包屑\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:6509-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164111 and revision id 14871. Se